# The build context is THIS folder. Only public/, nginx.conf.template and the
# two entrypoints are COPYed, so this is mostly belt-and-braces — but it keeps
# the context small and makes it obvious that documentation and the n8n Code
# node sources are not shipped.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Documentation, and the n8n sources for the OLD workflows. These are reference
# material that gets pasted into the n8n editor; nothing in the image reads
# them, and the form no longer talks to n8n at all.
README.md
n8n/

# Never let a real environment file into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.claude/
